<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia shares tumble 1.86 pct in early trading.</title>
<headline>Malaysia shares tumble 1.86 pct in early trading.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian shares tumbled 1.86 percent in early trading in reaction to the sharp fall of the Dow on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0145 GMT, the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange's key Composite Index was down 16.96 points or 1.86 percent to 893.22.</p>
